# ── PERF-PROBE LANE (BH-9786) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Daily 06:17 UTC: bin/perf-probe.sh loads each route of every enabled row in
# catalog/perf-probe.d/ (one session POST, one GET per route), upserts one
# perf_probe_results row per route per day through the jobs worker and writes
# one line per project to logs/perf-probe.log. 0 LLM calls. The hub lease
# gates it. Off: flags/lane-off-perf-probe, or bin/harness-ctl.sh off perf-probe.
# Note: docs/notes/2026-11-17-BH-9786-perf-probe.md.
# @hub-lanes
17 6 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/perf-probe.sh >> /root/harness/logs/perf-probe.log 2>&1
